hugo","id":17744793,"login":"mikkihugo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQ0Nzkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikkihugo/mikkihugo/commits/029c7a64a7865b44c579cadf34c6e8df46ec98f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-08T00:50:45Z","email":"mikkihugo@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mikkihugo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-08T00:50:45Z","email":"mikkihugo@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mikkihugo"},"message":"feat: add VectorDrive - self-learning distributed vector database\n\nAdd VectorDrive to profile showcasing production database infrastructure:\n\n**What VectorDrive Is:**\n- Distributed vector database competing with Pinecone/Qdrant/Milvus\n- 61µs latency (30x faster than Pinecone''s 2ms)\n- Self-learning through GNN layers - search improves over time\n- PostgreSQL extension with 120+ vector + 64+ graph SQL functions\n\n**Key Technical Innovations:**\n- GNN (Graph Neural Networks) that learn from access patterns\n- 39 attention mechanisms: Flash, Hyperbolic, Graph, MoE, etc.\n- SONA (Self-Optimizing Neural Architecture) for runtime adaptation\n- LoRA + EWC++ + ReasoningBank for continuous learning\n- 2-32x memory compression with adaptive tiered storage\n\n**Distributed Architecture:**\n- Raft consensus for leader election and log replication\n- 16 shards with consistent hashing\n- 3x replication with automatic failover\n- Multi-master replication with conflict resolution\n- PostgreSQL-native performance\n\n**Production Scale:**\n- 500M concurrent streams baseline\n- 15 global regions (Americas, EMEA, APAC)\n- <10ms p50 latency worldwide\n- 99.99% availability SLA\n- $0.0035 per stream/month\n\n**Advanced Features:**\n- Graph database with Cypher/SPARQL queries\n- Hyperbolic embeddings for hierarchical data\n- Sparse vectors (BM25/TF-IDF)\n- Agent economy with bounties and credits\n- Multi-tenancy (schema/RLS/DB-per-tenant)\n\nThis demonstrates expertise in:\n- Database internals and optimization\n- Distributed systems (Raft consensus)\n- Production infrastructure at scale\n- Advanced ML (GNN, attention mechanisms, SONA)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"73665e5f97a8a705283ec02bbbc8274249c3d96c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikkihugo/mikkihugo/git/trees/73665e5f97a8a705283ec02bbbc8274249c3d96c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikkihugo/mikkihugo/git/commits/029c7a64a7865b44c579cadf34c6e8df46ec98f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17744793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikkihugo","id":17744793,"login":"mikkihugo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQ0Nzkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/