ecture after\nanalyzing implementation documentation:\n\nKey Technical Innovations:\n- Replaces Git file storage with vector embeddings in pgvector\n- Stores code AS vectors (not text files) - fundamental paradigm shift\n- AST parsing + semantic feature extraction (1536-dim vectors)\n- Content addressing: SHA-256 hash → vector mapping\n- 70% storage reduction via semantic deduplication\n- Sub-100ms lookups via 3-layer cache (pgvector + Qdrant + Redis)\n- Gitea integration maintains Git API compatibility\n\nArchitecture Highlights:\n- NATS-based geographic replication (not HTTP)\n- Regional data sovereignty: US, EU, APAC clusters\n- Eventual consistency via NATS JetStream\n- Semantic similarity-based conflict resolution\n- Offline-capable per-region operation\n\nThis demonstrates:\n- Novel approach to version control (vectors vs files)\n- Production distributed systems architecture\n- Data sovereignty compliance engineering\n- Semantic code understanding at scale\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"526610a6e84e15aaf7f66256c57b7345e78a0620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikkihugo/mikkihugo/git/trees/526610a6e84e15aaf7f66256c57b7345e78a0620"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikkihugo/mikkihugo/git/commits/354f46ecb3f59e81c6035ac931ba7b1ef7659978","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17744793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikkihugo","id":17744793,"login":"mikkihugo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQ0Nzkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/orgs","received_even