o/mikkihugo/commits/27ccaa00605133c8e92c169758bb4b85649c9864/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-08T00:37:26Z","email":"mikkihugo@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mikkihugo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-08T00:37:26Z","email":"mikkihugo@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mikkihugo"},"message":"feat: add Guardian + Genesis autonomous AI safety system\n\nAdd cross-instance rollback coordination and safe experimentation\nsandbox to showcase advanced autonomous AI safety capabilities:\n\n- Guardian: Cross-instance rollback policy coordination\n  - Tracks code changes across all Singularity instances\n  - Auto-approves safe changes (>0.90 semantic similarity)\n  - Auto-rollbacks on threshold breach (<0.90 success rate)\n  - Learned rollback strategies from historical data\n  - pgvector semantic safety analysis\n\n- Genesis: Isolated sandbox for safe experimentation\n  - 3-layer isolation (filesystem, database, process)\n  - Auto-rollback on regression detection\n  - Comprehensive metrics tracking\n  - NATS-based coordination\n\nThese systems demonstrate competence in:\n- Autonomous AI safety engineering\n- Cross-instance distributed coordination\n- Semantic code analysis for risk assessment\n- Self-learning rollback strategies\n- Production-grade experimentation infrastructure\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"c2d5cc556578d748582072e4106a6bc2835b2904","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikkihugo/mikkihugo/git/trees/c2d5cc556578d748582072e4106a6bc2835b2904"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikkihugo/mikkihugo/git/commits/27ccaa00605133c8e92c169758bb4b85649c9864","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17744793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikkihugo/followers","following_