s)\n- Increased retries from 3 to 5 with exponential backoff (3s-30s)\n- Non-429/503 errors also retry instead of giving up immediately\n\nClient:\n- Failed generations stay in the sidebar as red \"Failed\" items\n  instead of silently vanishing\n- Replay button available on both failed AND timed-out items\n- User can dismiss failed items with X or replay them with same\n  settings\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"abbbc707ecbb35e1ab03b0466467404a38058987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom-rocks/design-forge/git/trees/abbbc707ecbb35e1ab03b0466467404a38058987"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom-rocks/design-forge/git/commits/9c052c9d42487e3e5d0c28d8b514c3443c8c4370","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118841400?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tom-rocks","id":118841400,"login":"tom-rocks","node_id":"U_kgDOBxVgOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom-rocks","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tom-rocks/design-forge/commit/9c052c9d42487e3e5d0c28d8b514c3443c8c4370","node_id":"C_kwDOQ2MmfNoAKDljMDUyYzlkNDI0ODdlM2U1ZDBjMjhkOGI1MTRjMzQ0M2M4YzQzNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github