"https://api.github.com/users/minidomo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/minidomo","id":32505118,"login":"minidomo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTA1MTE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minidomo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minidomo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minidomo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minidomo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minidomo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/minidomo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/251027-Java/P3-Group2/commits/41ddea76babc03194a9279eb24d1d6fecaddd758/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-16T15:25:26Z","email":"minidomou@gmail.com","name":"JB Ladera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-16T15:25:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ci): set up Jenkins for automated testing and building (#32)\n\nI''ve already set up Jenkins to run on a VPS. The repository where I''ve\ntested image publishing is located\n[here](https://hub.docker.com/r/minidomo/gemdeck/tags). Documentation on\nthe features available and setting up Jenkins can be found in the\n[README](https://github.com/251027-Java/P3-Group2/tree/jenkins/.jenkins).\n\nOpted for a single Jenkinsfile since we have a monorepo, and I would\nprefer to keep the logic centralized. With my features, such as\nautodetection and pipeline configuration file through a file `.ci.json`,\nit should be pretty easy to configure the running for both frontend and\nbackend directories. These features are detailed in the README.\n\nCloses #8","tree":{"sha":"03a1a6622da6ffd9477fd522da7f9212a711a063","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/251027-Java/P3-Group2/git/trees/03a1a6622da6ffd9477fd522da7f9212a711a063"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/251027-Java/P3-Group2/git/commits/41ddea76babc03194a9279e